{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465408-quick-v5-rule-question","id":1465408,"title":"Quick v5 rule question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-10-26T08:54:55-07:00","id":1465408,"title":"Quick v5 rule question","content":"So i noticed, reading the basic rule book, that a few disciplines are rolled with a skill + discipline rather attribute+discpline like a celerity power is rolled with athletics.<br /> <br /> Would an appropriate specialisation in athlethics increase the dice pool for the power by 1?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4364-orkar","name":"Orkar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4364_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-26T09:24:57-07:00","id":1465413,"title":"","content":"So I'm not sure where you're seeing a skill + discipline in Celerity. There are some powers that require an Attribute + Skill roll, such as Blink, but those are incidental rolls to the Discipline that come from the Discipline's function (like the needed Dex + Athletics check for Blink if you're running over rough terrain so you don't trip and fall), not from an activation (like Presence activates Awe, which then modifies incidental dice pools).<br /> <br /> Those incidental pools would benefit from appropriate specialties, at storyteller discretion (like, I'd certainly allow a Sure-Footed Athletics specialty to apply). But you wouldn't specialize in like, Athletics: Blink normally. As always, that part is an ST discretion thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-26T13:57:28-07:00","id":1465435,"title":"","content":"All disciplines that require a roll to *activate* are rolled with Attribute+Discipline. But if you successfully activate a discipline and then have to deal with the consequences of that activation, it may require a normal skill roll. So you activate Awe, for example, with a Manipulation+Presence roll, and should you succeed in turning it on, you then add your Presence dots to Charisma based *skill* rolls.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2462-karlb","name":"KarlB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"90"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-26T14:00:00-07:00","id":1465436,"title":"","content":"I don't see a problem in choosing the Discipline itself as a specialization, but indeed it affects incidental rolls and not activation rolls. It is a trade-off of always having the specialization cover you when using the Discipline but never outside it, and I can easily envision a vampire training specifically to deal with such incidental effects of their powers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}